<title>USA: Maryland $17 mln deal yields 8.317 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>Maryland $17 mln deal yields 8.317 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ferris Baker Watts Inc said Tuesday it tentatively priced $16.8 million Maryland Economic Development Corp bonds at a top tax-exempt yield of approximately 8.317 percent in 2026.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:  </p>
<p>MARYLAND ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT CORPORATION</p>
<p>RE: $16,800,000*</p>
<p>NURSING FACILITY MORTGAGE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>(RAVENWOOD HEALTHCARE, INC. FACILITY)</p>
<p>					    16,305,000*</p>
<p>					    SERIES 1996A</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: NR		    S&amp;P: NR</p>
<p>    DATED: 09/05/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 02/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 08/01</p>
<p>MATURITY		 AMOUNT*    COUPON	 PRICE</p>
<p>08/01/2007		1,490M    7.50  %	100.00</p>
<p>08/01/2015		3,655M    8.125 %	100.00</p>
<p>08/01/2026	     11,160M    8.25  %	 99.25</p>
<p>						    (Approx. Yield 8.317)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 08/01/2006    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 08/01/2008</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>			  495,000*</p>
<p>					    SERIES 1996B</p>
